@startuml
' MC-01 — maintained design model for CU-01 / DS-01
title MC-01 · CU-01 design class model\nDomain rules, application-owned contracts, replaceable adapters
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam linetype ortho
hide empty members

package "Domain values and rules" {
  class Cart {
    +validate() : void
    +subtotal(products : Map<String,Product>, currency : String) : int
  }
  class CartLine {
    +productCode : String {readOnly}
    +quantity : int {readOnly}
  }
  class Product {
    +code : String {readOnly}
    +unitPrice : int {readOnly}
    +currency : String {readOnly}
  }
  class Coupon {
    +code : String {readOnly}
    +kind : String {readOnly}
    +minimumSubtotal : int {readOnly}
    +expiresAt : DateTime {readOnly}
    +currency : String {readOnly}
    +config : Map<String,Object> {readOnly}
    +check_eligibility(subtotal : int, evaluatedAt : DateTime, currency : String) : void
  }
  class PriceQuote {
    +subtotal : int {readOnly}
    +discount : int {readOnly}
    +payable : int {readOnly}
    +currency : String {readOnly}
  }
  Cart "0..*" --> "0..*" CartLine : lines
  Cart ..> Product : trusted price values
  CartLine ..> Product : code identity
  PriceQuote ..> Cart : summarizes
  PriceQuote ..> Coupon : optional rule origin
}

package "Application contracts and calculation seam" {
  interface ProductCatalog <<solution>> {
    +lookup_product(code : String) : Optional<Product>
  }
  interface CouponCatalog <<solution>> {
    +lookup_coupon(code : String) : Optional<Coupon>
  }
  interface PolicyResolver <<solution>> {
    +resolve(coupon : Optional<Coupon>) : DiscountPolicy
  }
  interface DiscountPolicy <<solution>> {
    +discount(subtotal : int, currency : String) : int
  }
  class NoDiscount <<solution>> {
    +discount(subtotal : int, currency : String) : int
  }
  class FixedDiscount <<solution>> {
    +amount : int {readOnly}
    +discount(subtotal : int, currency : String) : int
  }
  class PercentageDiscount <<solution>> {
    +basisPoints : int {readOnly}
    +discount(subtotal : int, currency : String) : int
  }
  class QuoteService <<solution>> {
    -product_catalog : ProductCatalog
    -coupon_catalog : CouponCatalog
    -policy_resolver : PolicyResolver
    +quote(cart : Cart, currency : String, couponCode : Optional<String>, evaluatedAt : DateTime) : PriceQuote
  }
  class Refusal <<solution>> {
    +reasonCategory : String {readOnly}
  }
  NoDiscount ..|> DiscountPolicy
  FixedDiscount ..|> DiscountPolicy
  PercentageDiscount ..|> DiscountPolicy
  ProductCatalog -[hidden]down-> CouponCatalog
  CouponCatalog -[hidden]down-> PolicyResolver
  PolicyResolver -[hidden]down-> DiscountPolicy
  NoDiscount -[hidden]down-> FixedDiscount
  FixedDiscount -[hidden]down-> PercentageDiscount
  QuoteService ..> ProductCatalog
  QuoteService ..> CouponCatalog
  QuoteService ..> PolicyResolver
  QuoteService ..> Cart
  QuoteService ..> Coupon
  QuoteService ..> PriceQuote : creates
  QuoteService ..> DiscountPolicy : invokes
  QuoteService ..> Refusal : propagates
  PolicyResolver ..> DiscountPolicy : returns configured policy
}

package "Local boundary and adapters" {
  class QuoteRequestPort <<solution>> {
    -service : QuoteService
    +handle(request : Map<String,Object>) : Map<String,Object>
  }
  class InMemoryCatalog <<solution>> {
    -products : Map<String,Object>
    -coupons : Map<String,Object>
    +lookup_product(code : String) : Optional<Product>
    +lookup_coupon(code : String) : Optional<Coupon>
    +snapshot() : Map<String,Object>
  }
  class RegistryPolicyResolver <<solution>> {
    -registrations : Map<String,PolicyFactory>
    +resolve(coupon : Optional<Coupon>) : DiscountPolicy
  }
  InMemoryCatalog ..|> ProductCatalog
  InMemoryCatalog ..|> CouponCatalog
  RegistryPolicyResolver ..|> PolicyResolver
  QuoteRequestPort ..> QuoteService
  QuoteRequestPort ..> Cart : decodes input
  QuoteRequestPort ..> Refusal : maps to failed result
  RegistryPolicyResolver ..> DiscountPolicy : configured factories
  InMemoryCatalog -[hidden]down-> RegistryPolicyResolver
  RegistryPolicyResolver -[hidden]down-> QuoteRequestPort
}

note bottom of Cart
  An unvalidated request may have zero lines.
  The lines association is a read-only Python tuple, not duplicate storage.
  validate requires a nonempty Cart and integer quantity 1..99, excluding Boolean.
  subtotal uses only resolved trusted prices; CNY nonnegative integer cents.
  Immutable value parts may be shared: association, not exclusive composition.
end note
note bottom of Coupon
  Eligibility checks integer minimum, CNY, UTC expiry, then time and threshold.
  Policy construction checks kind-specific configuration separately.
  Negative minimum policy is explicitly outside the verified baseline.
end note
note bottom of PriceQuote
  Constructor contract: integer CNY cents,
  0 <= discount <= subtotal; payable = subtotal - discount.
  Construction is lifecycle behavior, not a modeled ordinary operation.
end note
note bottom of DiscountPolicy
  Same accepted subtotal domain for every implementation:
  nonnegative integer cents, CNY; result in 0..subtotal;
  deterministic, no input or policy-state mutation.
  Finite shared contract cases support, but do not prove universal substitution.
end note
note bottom of RegistryPolicyResolver
  PolicyFactory = callable(Coupon) -> DiscountPolicy, registered at composition root.
  Default fixed/percentage factories validate their parameters.
  Extension may add a factory and registration; core workflow remains unchanged.
end note
legend bottom
MC-01 is the stable model identity. Class identities are enumerated in provenance.md.
Python Mapping, Optional, Tuple, DateTime and callable types have explicit mappings there.
Typed state describes validated use; deliberately malformed inputs are refused at validation.
No persistence, order capability, framework or catalog network client is introduced.
endlegend
@enduml
